# The build of the Dockerfile needs only the Go module, its sources and those of request-cert,
# token-setup and request-jwt, the embedded assets and page templates, the help serve shows at
# /help/ and the guides serve --docs shows at /docs/.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!*.go
!cmd/request-cert
!cmd/token-setup
!cmd/request-jwt
!assets
!templates
!help
!docs/*.md
!docs/workload-identity/*.md
